# Prebuilt, signed virtual-display driver payload. These files must be stored
# byte-for-byte: the catalog (.cat) signs the exact bytes of the .dll and .inf,
# and any end-of-line normalization would invalidate the signature and stop
# the driver from loading. Override the repository's `* text=auto eol=lf` rule.
quickdesk_display.dll binary
quickdesk_display.cat binary
nefconw.exe          binary
quickdesk_display.inf -text
